# Live vendor data dropped for design reference (SBN template, SAP SQVI export).
# Real vendor names, tax IDs, and emails must never reach GitHub — only the
# folder's README is tracked.
vendor-sbn-upload-bot/reference-files/*
!vendor-sbn-upload-bot/reference-files/README.md

# Sample invoices (PDF and XML) and validation-site screenshots dropped for design
# reference. Real invoices carry supplier names, bank details, and amounts — only the
# folder's README is tracked.
invoice-signature-verification-bot/reference-files/*
!invoice-signature-verification-bot/reference-files/README.md

